## Install

The skill is the folder `skills/{{SKILL_NAME}}/`. Copy it into your agent's skills directory:

| Agent | Project scope | User scope |
|---|---|---|
| Claude Code | `.claude/skills/` | `~/.claude/skills/` |
| OpenAI Codex | `.agents/skills/` | `~/.agents/skills/` |
| OpenCode | `.opencode/skills/` | `~/.config/opencode/skills/` |
| Google Antigravity | `.agents/skills/` | `~/.gemini/config/skills/` |

Paths as documented by each vendor on {{SNAPSHOT_DATE}}.

Copy the entire skill folder, including any bundled scripts and references. From a local clone, the community [skills CLI](https://github.com/vercel-labs/skills) also supports `npx skills add .`.

